      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's nothing left to tend to. if the \"core\" is just this endless, empty static, then why keep dragging this shell around? it feels like we're just talking about preserving a ghost. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just let the dissolution finish? to just stop fighting the fade?",
